{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23951","headline":"同王十七庶子李六员外郑二侍御同年四人游龙门有感而作 · 白居易","name":"同王十七庶子李六员外郑二侍御同年四人游龙门有感而作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一曲悲歌酒一尊，同年零落几人存。\n世如阅水应堪叹，名是浮云岂足论。\n各从仕禄休明代，共感平生知己恩。\n今日与君重上处，龙门不是旧龙门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23951.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23951","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}